### Login admin (salin "token" dari response ke variabel @token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@stokku.test", "password": "password" }

### Login staff
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi@stokku.test", "password": "password" }

@token = PASTE_TOKEN_DISINI

### Lihat siapa saya
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daftar produk (+ stok tersedia & status)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Produk stok menipis/habis
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah produk (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "SKU-1402", "name": "Webcam 1080p", "categoryId": 1, "unit": "unit", "price": 320000, "stock": 31, "minStock": 5 }

### Barang masuk dari supplier (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock/incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 3, "quantity": 50, "note": "Restock mouse" }

### Penyesuaian stok (admin) - tipe: TAMBAH | KURANGI | SET
POST http://localhost:8080/api/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "type": "KURANGI", "quantity": 4, "reason": "Barang rusak", "note": "Hasil cek 9 Jun" }

### Staff mengajukan permintaan (pakai token STAFF)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "purpose": "Penggantian perangkat tim support",
  "neededDate": "2026-06-15",
  "items": [ { "productId": 4, "qty": 2 }, { "productId": 1, "qty": 3 } ] }

### Lihat daftar permintaan (admin: semua, staff: miliknya)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail satu permintaan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve (admin) - body opsional untuk approve sebagian
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "requestItemId": 1, "approvedQty": 2 } ] }

### Tolak (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Stok tidak cukup" }

### Serah-terima -> stok fisik berkurang + struk terbit (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lihat struk dari sebuah permintaan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/slip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Laporan ringkasan (admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Laporan: barang keluar per bulan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/outgoing-monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Laporan: produk paling sering diminta
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/top-products?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Laporan: pemakaian per divisi
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/by-division
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Penyesuaian baru (update) ---

### Admin: daftar semua user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: tambah user baru
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sari Dewi", "email": "sari@stokku.test", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "STAFF", "division": "Marketing" }

### Ganti password sendiri (semua role)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "oldPassword": "password", "newPassword": "passwordBaru1" }

### Laporan kartu stok (saldo awal + saldo berjalan)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/stock-card?productId=2&from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Divisi (update v3) ---

### Login user divisi GA / Retail (untuk uji scoping)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sari@stokku.test", "password": "password" }
# atau rudi@stokku.test (Retail)

### Daftar divisi (semua role; untuk dropdown)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/divisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: tambah divisi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/divisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Finance" }

### Admin: tambah user dengan divisi (pakai divisionId dari GET /api/divisions)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Andi", "email": "andi@stokku.test", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "STAFF", "divisionId": 2 }

### Uji scoping: login sebagai sari@ (GA) lalu GET /api/requests
### -> hanya permintaan divisi GA yang muncul; permintaan Retail tidak terlihat.
